gaPc(){return"Watch it rise and fall"},
gaPb(){return"A timer runs and the screen tells you what to notice at each moment. Breathe normally and let the wave pass."},
gaPe(){return"Rate it again"},
gaPd(){return"At the end you rate it again and see if it changed. If it's still high, add 5 more minutes."},
gaPj(){return"Urges rise, reach a high point and then fall, even if you do nothing. Watching them without fighting or giving in helps you get through them. In a study with smokers, those who learned this technique smoked less the following week (Bowen and Marlatt, 2009)."},
gchL(){return"How strong is the urge right now? From 1 to 10 (optional)"},
