gaP_(){return"If you want, you continue with slow breathing to relax before sleep."},
gaP5(){return"In one study, people who wrote their to-dos for tomorrow before bed fell asleep faster than those who wrote what they had already done. The more detailed the list, the faster (Scullin et al., 2018)."},
